        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)",
              "& when (@overlay)": {
                ".mbr-overlay": {
                  "background": "@overlayColor",
                  "opacity": "@overlayOpacity"
                }
              }
            },
            ".item-img": {
              "position": "relative",
              "img": {
                "transition": "all 0.2s",
                "object-fit": "cover"
              }
            },
            ".cardbg": {
              "background": "@contentBg",
              "height": "100%",
              "min-height": "160px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "border": "1px solid currentColor",
              "border-radius": "1rem",
              "width": "fit-content",
              "padding": "0.2rem 0.7rem",
              "display": "inline-block"
            },
            ".image-wrapper": {
              "overflow": "hidden"
            },
            ".item1": {
              "margin-bottom": "2rem !important"
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "position": "relative",
              "background": "@cardsBg",
              "border": "3px solid @cardsBg",
              "overflow": "hidden",
              "height": "100%",
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-flow": "column nowrap",
              ".item-footer": {
                "margin-top": "auto"
              }
            },
            ".item-link": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "bottom": "8px",
              "right": "90px",
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".item1, .item": {
              "transition": "transform 0.3s",
              ".item": {
                "&:hover": {
                  "cursor": "pointer"
                }
              },
              "&:hover": {
                ".link-icon-wrapper span": {
                  "transform": "rotate(-20deg) scale(1.3)"
                }
              },
              "margin-bottom": "2rem"
            },
            ".card2": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "margin-top": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".link-icon-wrapper": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "right": "-1px",
              "padding": "2px",
              "bottom": "-1px",
              "background": "@cardsBg",
              "width": "68px",
              "height": "68px",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "flex-end",
              "align-items": "flex-end",
              "border-top-left-radius": "50%",
              "border-bottom-right-radius": "2rem",
              "z-index": "3",
              ".icon-wrap": {
                "background": "@iconBg",
                "width": "55px",
                "height": "55px",
                "transition": "all 0.3s",
                "display": "flex",
                "justify-content": "center",
                "align-items": "center",
                "border-radius": "50%",
                "span": {
                  "color": "@iconColor",
                  "font-size": "1.1rem",
                  "transition": "all 0.3s",
                  "display": "block",
                  "padding-top": "1px"
                }
              },
              ".svg1": {
                "position": "absolute",
                "top": "-29px",
                "right": "0px",
                "transform": "rotate(180deg)",
                "width": "30px",
                "path": {
                  "fill": "@cardsBg"
                }
              },
              ".svg2": {
                "position": "absolute",
                "transform": "rotate(180deg)",
                "width": "30px",
                "bottom": "0",
                "left": "-29px",
                "path": {
                  "fill": "@cardsBg"
                }
              }
            },
            ".item-content": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "left": "0",
              "margin-top": "1rem",
              "padding": "0 1.5rem 2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "0 1rem 1.4rem",
                "margin-top": "1rem"
              },
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-direction": "column",
              "height": "100%"
            },
            "img, .item-img": {
              "width": "100%"
            },
            ".item:focus, span:focus": {
              "outline": "none"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".item": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".item-title": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".item-subtitle": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle, .subtitle-wrap, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_name": "contacts2",
          "_sourceTheme": "ascentm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"ascentm5 contacts2\" group=\"contacts\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\">\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showLink\" title=\"Link\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsBg\" title=\"Card BG\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"contentBg\" title=\"Content BG\" value=\"#4f6df5\">\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Icon Color\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconBg\" title=\"Icon BG\" value=\"#000000\">\n\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" required>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#fafafa\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.1\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle || showmainButton\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                        <b>Title</b>\n                    </h4>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row\">\n\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12\">\n                <div class=\"row h-100\">\n\n                    <div class=\"item features-image h-100 col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12 active\">\n                        <div class=\"item-wrapper card2 h-100\">\n                            <div class=\"item-img h-100\">\n                                <div class=\"cardbg\">\n\n                                </div>\n\n                                <div class=\"link-icon-wrapper\">\n                                    <svg class=\"svg1\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n                                        <path d=\"m100,0H0v100C0,44.77,44.77,0,100,0Z\"></path>\n                                    </svg>\n\n                                    <div class=\"icon-wrap\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn mobi-mbri-right mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <svg class=\"svg2\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n                                        <path d=\"m100,0H0v100C0,44.77,44.77,0,100,0Z\"></path>\n                                    </svg>\n\n                                </div>\n\n                                <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                                    <div class=\"subtitle-wrap mb-3 w-100\">\n                                        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .subtitle-wrap, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                                            Our\n                                            Services</h5>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Got questions?<br></b></h5>\n\n                                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\">\n                                        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Suspendisse a lacus non\n                                        elit pretium\n                                        tristique. Proin pulvinar placerat mi, sed maximus sapien bibendum eu. Duis vel\n                                        lorem sagittis,\n                                        commodo enim nec, vulputate sapien.&nbsp;</p>\n                                </div>\n                                <h4 class=\"item-link mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-link\" mbr-if=\"showLink\">\n                                    <div><br></div>\n                                    <div>Get in touch</div>\n                                </h4>\n\n                            </div>\n\n\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n\n\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uwQQsMwNcW",
          "_anchor": "contacts2-7h",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    "page2.html": {
      "settings": {
        "title": "blog",
        "meta_descr": "Capture and convert leads through location-based digital strategies that engage consumers near your business and extend your reach far beyond.",
        "header_custom": "",
        "footer_custom": "<script src=\"https://app.boei.help/embed/k/54dd9bef-8ac5-4e14-8ea1-7a2edde3618a\" async></script>",
        "html_before": "",
        "order": "2"
      },
      "components": [
        {
          "_name": "tabs01",
          "_sourceTheme": "essencem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"tabs01 essencem5\" group=\"List\" plugins=\"mbr-tabs\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <header>Tabs</header>\n        <select title=\"Count\" name=\"bootstrapTabs\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\" selected>8</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Tabs Color\" value=\"#000000\" name=\"tabs\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Tabs BG\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"tabsBg\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Tabs Active BG\" value=\"#00d0f3\" name=\"active\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Shadow Color\" value=\"#000305\" name=\"shadow\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/essencem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/essencem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#000000\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>VARIOUS SPHERES OF INFLUENCE</b>\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"tabs-wrap\">\n                    <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item first mbr-fonts-style\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\">\n                            <a class=\"nav-link show active\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tab1\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n                                <b>Policy and Advocacy</b>\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 1\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\">\n                            <a class=\"nav-link mbr-fonts-style\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tab2\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n                                <b>Scientific Research</b>\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 2\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\">\n                            <a class=\"nav-link mbr-fonts-style\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tab3\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n                                <b>Community Engagement</b>\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 3\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\"><a class=\"nav-link mbr-fonts-style active\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tabs01-8c_tab3\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n                                <strong>Corporate</strong>\n                            </a></li>\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\"><a class=\"nav-link mbr-fonts-style active\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tabs01-8c_tab4\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n                                <strong>Communication</strong>\n                            </a></li>\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 5\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\"><a class=\"nav-link mbr-fonts-style active\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tabs01-8c_tab5\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n                                <strong>Technology</strong>\n                            </a></li>\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 6\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\"><a class=\"nav-link mbr-fonts-style active\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tabs01-8c_tab6\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n                                <strong>Collaboration</strong>\n                            </a></li>\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 7\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\">\n                            <a class=\"nav-link mbr-fonts-style\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tab8\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n                                <b>Legal Action</b>\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                    <div id=\"tab1\" class=\"tab-pane in active\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/essencem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            <div class=\"item-content\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                                    Environmental laws\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                                    Regulations, and agreements to promote sustainability and conservation.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                    <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-info-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                        Read more\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"tab2\" class=\"tab-pane\" role=\"tabpanel\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 1\">\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/essencem5/components/_images/background4.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            <div class=\"item-content\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                                    Understanding of ecosystems\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                                    Climate change, and the impact of human activities on the environment.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                    <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-info-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                        Read more\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"tab3\" class=\"tab-pane\" role=\"tabpanel\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 2\">\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/essencem5/components/_images/background5.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            <div class=\"item-content\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                                    Grassroots movements\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                                    Play a pivotal role in fostering environmental awareness and action at the local\n                                    level.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                    <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-info-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                        Read more\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"tab4\" class=\"tab-pane\" role=\"tabpanel\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 3\">\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/essencem5/components/_images/background6.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            <div class=\"item-content\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                                    Corporate practices\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                                    Corporate partnerships with environmental organizations contribute to positive\n                                    change on a larger scale.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                    <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-info-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                        Read more\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"tab5\" class=\"tab-pane\" role=\"tabpanel\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 4\">\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/essencem5/components/_images/background7.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            <div class=\"item-content\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                                    Media platforms\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                                    To communicate information, raise awareness, and influence public opinion.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                    <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-info-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                        Read more\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"tab6\" class=\"tab-pane\" role=\"tabpanel\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 5\">\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/essencem5/components/_images/background8.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            <div class=\"item-content\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                                    Sustainable technologies\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                                    From renewable energy advancements to waste reduction technologies.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                    <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-info-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                        Read more\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"tab7\" class=\"tab-pane\" role=\"tabpanel\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 6\">\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/essencem5/components/_images/background9.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            <div class=\"item-content\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                                    Transcend borders\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                                    the environmental community engages in international collaboration to address global\n                                    issues.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                    <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-info-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                        Read more\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div id=\"tab8\" class=\"tab-pane\" role=\"tabpanel\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 7\">\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                            <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/essencem5/components/_images/background10.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            <div class=\"item-content\">\n                                <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                                    Legal action to protect\n                                </h4>\n                                <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                                    Lawsuits against polluters, habitat destruction, or inadequate environmental\n                                    assessments.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                    <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-info-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                        Read more\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "overflow": "hidden",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 80px",
                "@media (max-width: 1200px)": {
                  "padding": "0 40px"
                },
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0 22px"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 22px"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "justify-content": "center"
            },
            ".title-wrapper": {
              ".mbr-section-title": {
                "margin-bottom": "40px",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "20px"
                }
              }
            },
            ".tabs-wrap": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "margin-bottom": "20px",
              ".nav.nav-tabs": {
                "display": "inline-flex",
                "justify-content": "center",
                "border": "none",
                ".nav-item": {
                  "padding": "0",
                  "border": "none",
                  "border-radius": "0",
                  "margin": "0 22px 22px",
                  "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out",
                  ".nav-link": {
                    "display": "flex",
                    "align-items": "center",
                    "justify-content": "center",
                    "padding": "10px 40px",
                    "margin-bottom": "0",
                    "border": "none",
                    "color": "@tabs",
                    "background-color": "@tabsBg",
                    "border-radius": "100px !important",
                    "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out"
                  },
                  ".nav-link.active": {
                    "background-color": "@active"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".content-wrapper": {
              "position": "relative",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "align-items": "flex-end",
              "min-height": "520px",
              "img": {
                "position": "absolute",
                "top": "0",
                "width": "200vh",
                "height": "100%",
                "border-radius": "0 !important",
                "object-fit": "cover"
              },
              "&::before": {
                "content": "''",
                "position": "absolute",
                "bottom": "0",
                "width": "200vh",
                "height": "45%",
                "background-image": "linear-gradient(transparent, @shadow 130px)",
                "z-index": "1"
              },
              ".item-content": {
                "width": "100%",
                "position": "relative",
                "z-index": "1",
                "margin-bottom": "60px",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "margin-bottom": "30px"
                },
                ".card-title": {
                  "margin-bottom": "8px"
                },
                ".card-text": {
                  "margin-bottom": "10px"
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".card-title": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".card-text": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            }
          },
          "_cid": "ux7yK86zeb",
          "_anchor": "tabs01-8c",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "tabs01",
          "_sourceTheme": "trackm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\"\r\n        class=\"tabs01 trackm5\"\r\n        group=\"Tabs\"\r\n        plugins=\"mbr-tabs\"\r\n        mbr-class=\"{\r\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\r\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\"\r\n>\r\n    <mbr-parameters>\r\n        <header>Size</header>\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\"/>\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked/>\r\n        <input\r\n                type=\"range\"\r\n                inline\r\n                title=\"Top\"\r\n                name=\"paddingTop\"\r\n                min=\"0\"\r\n                max=\"12\"\r\n                step=\"1\"\r\n                value=\"0\"\r\n                condition=\"fullScreen == false\"\r\n        />\r\n        <input\r\n                type=\"range\"\r\n                inline\r\n                title=\"Bottom\"\r\n                name=\"paddingBottom\"\r\n                min=\"0\"\r\n                max=\"12\"\r\n                step=\"1\"\r\n                value=\"0\"\r\n                condition=\"fullScreen == false\"\r\n        />\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\"/>\r\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked/>\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDesc\" checked/>\r\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Description BG\" value=\"#e1edff\" name=\"desc\" condition=\"showDesc\" selected/>\r\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#bad6ff\" name=\"border\" condition=\"showDesc\" selected/>\r\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Container BG\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"container\" selected/>\r\n        <header>Tabs</header>\r\n        <select title=\"Count\" name=\"bootstrapTabs\">\r\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\r\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\r\n        </select>\r\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Tabs Color\" value=\"#3283fb\" name=\"tabs\" selected/>\r\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Tabs BG\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"tabsBg\" selected/>\r\n        <header>Cards</header>\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showIcon\" title=\"Card Icon\" checked/>\r\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"icon\" condition=\"showIcon\" selected/>\r\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon BG\" value=\"#3283fb\" name=\"iconBg\" condition=\"showIcon\" selected/>\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked/>\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Description\" name=\"showCardDesc\" checked/>\r\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Overlay\" value=\"#222222\" name=\"card\" selected/>\r\n        <header>Background</header>\r\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\r\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\"/>\r\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#e2e7f8\" selected/>\r\n        </fieldset>\r\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\r\n        <input\r\n                type=\"image\"\r\n                title=\"Fallback Image\"\r\n                value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\"\r\n                name=\"fallBackImage\"\r\n                condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\"\r\n        />\r\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\"/>\r\n        <input\r\n                type=\"color\"\r\n                title=\"Overlay Color\"\r\n                name=\"overlayColor\"\r\n                value=\"#ffffff\"\r\n                condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"\r\n        />\r\n        <input\r\n                type=\"range\"\r\n                inline\r\n                title=\"Opacity\"\r\n                name=\"overlayOpacity\"\r\n                min=\"0\"\r\n                max=\"1\"\r\n                step=\"0.1\"\r\n                value=\"0.8\"\r\n                condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"\r\n        />\r\n    </mbr-parameters>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\r\n    <div\r\n            class=\"mbr-overlay\"\r\n            mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"\r\n            opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\"\r\n            bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"\r\n    ></div>\r\n\r\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\r\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\r\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-3 card\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">\r\n                <div class=\"desc-wrapper\">\r\n                    <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\"\r\n                       data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc, .desc-wrapper\"\r\n                       mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\r\n                        New music\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-9 card\">\r\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\"\r\n                    data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .tabs-wrap\"\r\n                    mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\r\n                    Releases the band <br> has <span>in store for you</span>\r\n                </h2>\r\n                <div class=\"tabs-wrap\">\r\n                    <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\r\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item first mbr-fonts-style\"\r\n                            data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\">\r\n                            <a class=\"nav-link show active\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tab1\"\r\n                               aria-selected=\"true\">\r\n                                Summer\r\n                            </a>\r\n                        </li>\r\n                        <li mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"nav-item\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 1\"\r\n                            data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnAdd,-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-iconFont\">\r\n                            <a class=\"nav-link mbr-fonts-style\" role=\"tab\" data-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tab2\"\r\n                               data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-selected=\"true\">\r\n                                Autumn\r\n                            </a>\r\n                        </li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"col-12 card\">\r\n                <div class=\"tab-content\">\r\n                    <div id=\"tab1\" class=\"tab-pane in active\" role=\"tabpanel\">\r\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\r\n                            <div class=\"item features-image item-mb\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/track/image3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-play mobi-mbri\"\r\n                                                  mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\r\n                                            </span>\r\n                                        </a>\r\n                                        <div class=\"item-content\">\r\n                                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                                mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"\r\n                                                data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\r\n                                                Studio Albums\r\n                                            </h4>\r\n                                            <p class=\"card-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                               data-app-selector=\".card-desc\" mbr-if=\"showCardDesc\" >\r\n                                                2030\r\n                                            </p>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item features-image item-mb\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/track/image13.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-play mobi-mbri\"\r\n                                                  mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\r\n                                            </span>\r\n                                        </a>\r\n                                        <div class=\"item-content\">\r\n                                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                                mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"\r\n                                                data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\r\n                                                Extended Plays\r\n                                            </h4>\r\n                                            <p class=\"card-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                               data-app-selector=\".card-desc\" mbr-if=\"showCardDesc\" >\r\n                                                2030\r\n                                            </p>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item features-image item-mb\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/track/image18.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-play mobi-mbri\"\r\n                                                  mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\r\n                                            </span>\r\n                                        </a>\r\n                                        <div class=\"item-content\">\r\n                                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                                mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"\r\n                                                data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\r\n                                                Singles\r\n                                            </h4>\r\n                                            <p class=\"card-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                               data-app-selector=\".card-desc\" mbr-if=\"showCardDesc\" >\r\n                                                2030\r\n                                            </p>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item features-image item-mb\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/track/image19.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-play mobi-mbri\"\r\n                                                  mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\r\n                                            </span>\r\n                                        </a>\r\n                                        <div class=\"item-content\">\r\n                                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                                mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"\r\n                                                data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\r\n                                                Live Albums\r\n                                            </h4>\r\n                                            <p class=\"card-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                               data-app-selector=\".card-desc\" mbr-if=\"showCardDesc\" >\r\n                                                2030\r\n                                            </p>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item features-image item-mb\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/track/image11.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-play mobi-mbri\"\r\n                                                  mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\r\n                                            </span>\r\n                                        </a>\r\n                                        <div class=\"item-content\">\r\n                                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                                mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"\r\n                                                data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\r\n                                                Acoustic\r\n                                            </h4>\r\n                                            <p class=\"card-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                               data-app-selector=\".card-desc\" mbr-if=\"showCardDesc\" >\r\n                                                2030\r\n                                            </p>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item features-image item-mb\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/track/image17.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-play mobi-mbri\"\r\n                                                  mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\r\n                                            </span>\r\n                                        </a>\r\n                                        <div class=\"item-content\">\r\n                                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                                mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"\r\n                                                data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\r\n                                                Collaborations\r\n                                            </h4>\r\n                                            <p class=\"card-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                               data-app-selector=\".card-desc\" mbr-if=\"showCardDesc\" >\r\n                                                2030\r\n                                            </p>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div id=\"tab2\" class=\"tab-pane\" role=\"tabpanel\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 1\">\r\n                        <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\r\n                            <div class=\"item features-image item-mb\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/track/image1.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-play mobi-mbri\"\r\n                                                  mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\r\n                                            </span>\r\n                                        </a>\r\n                                        <div class=\"item-content\">\r\n                                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                                mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"\r\n                                                data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\r\n                                                B-Sides\r\n                                            </h4>\r\n                                            <p class=\"card-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                               data-app-selector=\".card-desc\" mbr-if=\"showCardDesc\" >\r\n                                                2030\r\n                                            </p>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item features-image item-mb\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/track/image4.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-play mobi-mbri\"\r\n                                                  mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\r\n                                            </span>\r\n                                        </a>\r\n                                        <div class=\"item-content\">\r\n                                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                                mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"\r\n                                                data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\r\n                                                Music Videos\r\n                                            </h4>\r\n                                            <p class=\"card-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                               data-app-selector=\".card-desc\" mbr-if=\"showCardDesc\" >\r\n                                                2030\r\n                                            </p>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item features-image item-mb\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/track/image5.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-play mobi-mbri\"\r\n                                                  mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\r\n                                            </span>\r\n                                        </a>\r\n                                        <div class=\"item-content\">\r\n                                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                                mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"\r\n                                                data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\r\n                                                Digital Exclusive\r\n                                            </h4>\r\n                                            <p class=\"card-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                               data-app-selector=\".card-desc\" mbr-if=\"showCardDesc\" >\r\n                                                2030\r\n                                            </p>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item features-image item-mb\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/track/image10.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-play mobi-mbri\"\r\n                                                  mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\r\n                                            </span>\r\n                                        </a>\r\n                                        <div class=\"item-content\">\r\n                                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                                mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"\r\n                                                data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\r\n                                                Projects\r\n                                            </h4>\r\n                                            <p class=\"card-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                               data-app-selector=\".card-desc\" mbr-if=\"showCardDesc\" >\r\n                                                2030\r\n                                            </p>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item features-image item-mb\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/track/image15.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-play mobi-mbri\"\r\n                                                  mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\r\n                                            </span>\r\n                                        </a>\r\n                                        <div class=\"item-content\">\r\n                                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                                mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"\r\n                                                data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\r\n                                                Multimedia\r\n                                            </h4>\r\n                                            <p class=\"card-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                               data-app-selector=\".card-desc\" mbr-if=\"showCardDesc\" >\r\n                                                2030\r\n                                            </p>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item features-image item-mb\">\r\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"item-img\">\r\n                                        <img src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/trackm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"#\">\r\n                                            <span mbr-icon=\"\" class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-play mobi-mbri\"\r\n                                                  mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\r\n                                            </span>\r\n                                        </a>\r\n                                        <div class=\"item-content\">\r\n                                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                                mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"\r\n                                                data-app-selector=\".card-title, .mbr-section-btn\">\r\n                                                Box Sets\r\n                                            </h4>\r\n                                            <p class=\"card-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"\r\n                                               data-app-selector=\".card-desc\" mbr-if=\"showCardDesc\" >\r\n                                                2030\r\n                                            </p>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</section>\r\n",
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "10px 8px"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
              ".container": {
                "padding": "10px 8px"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "border-radius": "25px",
              "background-color": "@container",
              "padding": "100px 32px",
              "margin": "0",
              "overflow": "hidden",
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "padding": "50px 2px"
              },
              ".card": {
                "padding": "0 8px"
              }
            },
            ".desc-wrapper": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "20px"
              },
              ".mbr-desc": {
                "display": "inline-flex",
                "border": "1px solid @border",
                "border-radius": "300px",
                "padding": "5px 25px",
                "background-color": "@desc",
                "margin-bottom": "0"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "margin-bottom": "50px",
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "30px"
              },
              "span": {
                "opacity": ".5"
              },
              "color": "#222222"
            },
            ".tabs-wrap": {
              "margin-bottom": "50px",
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "30px"
              },
              ".nav.nav-tabs": {
                "display": "inline-flex",
                "border": "none",
                ".nav-item": {
                  "padding": "0",
                  "border": "none",
                  "margin": "0 10px 10px 0",
                  "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out",
                  "&:last-child": {
                    "margin-right": "0"
                  },
                  ".nav-link": {
                    "margin-bottom": "0",
                    "color": "@tabs",
                    "background-color": "@tabsBg",
                    "padding": "35px 100px",
                    "display": "flex",
                    "align-items": "center",
                    "justify-content": "center",
                    "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out",
                    "border": "2px solid @tabs",
                    "border-radius": "100px !important",
                    "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                      "padding": "30px 50px"
                    }
                  },
                  ".nav-link.active": {
                    "color": "@tabsBg",
                    "background-color": "@tabs"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".content-wrapper": {
              "display": "grid",
              "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr",
              "gap": "16px",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr"
              },
              ".item": {
                "min-height": "300px",
                ".item-wrapper": {
                  "border-radius": "0 !important",
                  "height": "100%",
                  ".item-img": {
                    "display": "flex",
                    "flex-direction": "column",
                    "justify-content": "space-between",
                    "padding": "30px",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "border-radius": "25px !important",
                    "overflow": "hidden",
                    "height": "100%",
                    "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                      "padding": "20px 15px"
                    },
                    "img": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "top": "0",
                      "left": "0",
                      "width": "100%",
                      "height": "100%",
                      "border-radius": "0 !important",
                      "object-fit": "cover"
                    },
                    "&::before": {
                      "content": "''",
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "top": "0",
                      "left": "0",
                      "width": "100%",
                      "height": "100%",
                      "background-color": "@card",
                      "opacity": ".7",
                      "pointer-events": "none",
                      "z-index": "1"
                    },
                    "a": {
                      "width": "100%",
                      "position": "relative",
                      "z-index": "1",
                      "display": "block",
                      "text-align": "right",
                      "&:hover, &:focus": {
                        ".mbr-iconfont": {
                          "transform": "scale(1.15)"
                        }
                      },
                      ".mbr-iconfont": {
                        "width": "60px",
                        "height": "60px",
                        "border-radius": "100%",
                        "display": "inline-flex",
                        "align-items": "center",
                        "justify-content": "center",
                        "background-color": "@iconBg",
                        "color": "@icon",
                        "font-size": "16px",
                        "margin-left": "10px",
                        "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out",
                        "pointer-events": "visible"
                      }
                    },
                    ".item-content": {
                      "width": "100%",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "space-between",
                      "position": "relative",
                      "z-index": "1",
                      "pointer-events": "none",
                      ".card-title": {
                        "margin-bottom": "0",
                        "pointer-events": "visible"
                      },
                      ".card-desc": {
                        "margin-bottom": "0",
                        "pointer-events": "visible"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".item-menu-overlay": {
              ".btn-wrapper": {
                "margin-right": "25%"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-desc": {
              "color": "#3283fb"
            },
            ".card-title": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".card-desc": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            }
          },
          "_cid": "ux7yRRim53",
          "_anchor": "tabs01-8e",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "article02",
          "_sourceTheme": "healthm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article02 healthm5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\" checked>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDesc\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Description BG\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"descBg\" condition=\"showDesc ||showCardDesc\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Description Border\" value=\"#EDECEB\" name=\"borderDesc\" condition=\"showDesc || showCardDesc\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text 1\" name=\"showText_1\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle&quot;\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text 2\" name=\"showText_2\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Container BG\" value=\"#fbfaf9\" name=\"container\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border\" value=\"#EDECEB\" name=\"border\" selected>\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Name\" name=\"showName\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Role\" name=\"showRole\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"card\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/healthm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/healthm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-1745x1165.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"content-wrap\" mbr-if=\"showDesc || showTitle || showText\">\n                        <div class=\"desc-wrapper\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc, .desc-wrapper\">\n                                Article\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Revolutionize Your Local Business with Generative SEO</h2>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text_1 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText_1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text_1\">This guide will walk you through the essentials of generative SEO, its significance, and how it can benefit your local business.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"person-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"person-wrap\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-1920x1076.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            <div class=\"name-wrapper\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-name mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-name, .person-wrapper\">Renee Leach</p>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-role mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-role, .person-wrapper\">\n                                    Nutritionist Doctor\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"content-wrap\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle || showText_2\">\n                        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\"></h3>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text_2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText_2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text_2\">A Comprehensive Guide\n<br>\n<br>Staying competitive requires embracing the latest strategies. Generative SEO can significantly enhance your business's online presence. This guide will walk you through the essentials of generative SEO, its significance, and how it can benefit your local business.\n<br>\n<br>Understanding Generative SEO\n<br>\n<br>Generative SEO utilizes artificial intelligence (AI) to automatically create and optimize content for search engines. Unlike traditional SEO, which depends on manual keyword placement and backlinks, generative SEO harnesses AI to produce high-quality content effortlessly. This AI-powered method boosts your site's visibility on search engines like Google, making it easier for potential customers to discover your business.\n<br>\n<br>Why Generative SEO is Essential for Local Businesses\n<br>\n<br>Local businesses rely on visibility within their community to thrive. Here's how generative SEO can make a significant impact:\n<br>\n<br>Attracting Local Customers: Higher search engine rankings mean more local customers can find your business. When people search for the services or products you offer, appearing at the top of search results increases the chances they'll choose your business.\n<br>\n<br>Saving Time and Resources: AI-generated content minimizes the time and effort you need to spend on content creation. This allows you to concentrate on other vital aspects of your business, such as customer service and product development.\n<br>\n<br>Staying Competitive: Using the latest SEO strategies ensures you remain ahead of competitors still relying on outdated methods. Generative SEO helps maintain your relevance in a constantly changing digital landscape.\n<br>\n<br>How Generative SEO Works\n<br>\n<br>Generative SEO uses AI to streamline and enhance the content creation process. Here’s a closer look at how it functions:\n<br>\n<br>Data Collection: AI tools gather data on search trends, keywords, and user behavior, offering insights into what potential customers are searching for and how they interact with search results.\n<br>\n<br>Content Creation: Based on this data, AI generates content designed to match popular search queries. This includes blog posts, product descriptions, and other relevant content that appeals to your target audience.\n<br>\n<br>Optimization: The AI optimizes the generated content with relevant keywords and phrases, ensuring it aligns with SEO best practices, which increases the likelihood of your content ranking higher on search engine results pages.\n<br>\n<br>Publishing: The optimized content is published on your website. Regular updates keep your site fresh and engaging for visitors.\n<br>\n<br>Continuous Improvement: AI continuously monitors your content's performance, making adjustments based on new data and trends to ensure your content remains effective and relevant over time.\n<br>\n<br>Steps to Implement Generative SEO\n<br>\n<br>Implementing generative SEO for your local business involves several key steps:\n<br>\n<br>Choosing the Right Tools: Select AI tools that specialize in generative SEO. Popular options include OpenAI’s GPT-3, Jasper, and other AI-driven content generation platforms.\n<br>\n<br>Setting Clear Goals: Define your SEO strategy goals, such as increasing website traffic, boosting local awareness, or driving more sales. Clear goals help you measure the success of your SEO efforts.\n<br>\n<br>Creating Quality Content: Use AI to generate various content types, including blog posts, product descriptions, and service pages. Ensure the content is engaging, informative, and relevant to your audience.\n<br>\n<br>Monitoring Performance: Regularly check your content's performance using analytics tools. Track metrics like website traffic, bounce rate, and conversion rates to assess effectiveness.\n<br>\n<br>Staying Updated: SEO is constantly evolving, so it’s crucial to stay informed about the latest trends and updates. This helps you adapt your strategy and maintain your competitive edge.\n<br>\n<br>Real-Life Success Stories\n<br>\n<br>Generative SEO has already demonstrated success for many local businesses. Here are a couple of examples:\n<br>\n<br>Local Café: A small café leveraged generative SEO to optimize their menu descriptions and create blog posts about coffee trends. Within a few months, they experienced a 50% increase in website traffic and a substantial boost in local foot traffic. The AI-generated content helped them rank higher for local coffee-related searches, attracting more customers.\n<br>\n<br>Boutique Store: A boutique store used AI to craft engaging content for their product pages, resulting in higher search engine rankings and a 30% increase in online sales. The AI-driven approach enabled them to update their content regularly, keeping it fresh and relevant for their customers.\n<br>\n<br>Embrace the New Reality\n<br>\n<br>Generative SEO is a powerful tool that can help your local business grow by enhancing online visibility and attracting more customers. Embracing this strategy ensures your business continues to thrive in the digital age.\n<br>\n<br>Ready to elevate your local business with generative SEO? Contact us today to unlock the full potential of AI-driven content optimization. Let us help you transform your online presence and achieve success.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_styles": {
