          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article02 healthm5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDesc\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Description BG\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"descBg\" condition=\"showDesc ||showCardDesc\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Description Border\" value=\"#EDECEB\" name=\"borderDesc\" condition=\"showDesc || showCardDesc\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text 1\" name=\"showText_1\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle&quot;\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text 2\" name=\"showText_2\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Container BG\" value=\"#fbfaf9\" name=\"container\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border\" value=\"#EDECEB\" name=\"border\" selected>\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Name\" name=\"showName\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Role\" name=\"showRole\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"card\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-3.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-3.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background4.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"content-wrap\" mbr-if=\"showDesc || showTitle || showText\">\n                        <div class=\"desc-wrapper\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-desc mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-desc, .desc-wrapper\">\n                                Article\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Revolutionize Your Local Business with Generative SEO</h2>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text_1 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText_1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text_1\">\n                            In the arena of sports, where the pursuit of victory often takes center stage, the\n                            importance of health cannot be overstated.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"person-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"person-wrap\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-1920x1076.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            <div class=\"name-wrapper\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-name mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-name, .person-wrapper\">Renee Leach</p>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-role mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showRole\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-role, .person-wrapper\">\n                                    Nutritionist Doctor\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"content-wrap\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle || showText_2\">\n                        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\">\n                            Beyond Physical Strength\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text_2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText_2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text_2\">\n                            While athleticism and skill are undeniably crucial, it is the foundation of good health that\n                            truly propels athletes to their peak performance and sustains their longevity in their\n                            respective disciplines. Beyond the visible displays of strength and agility, lies a deeper\n                            understanding of health that encompasses both physical and mental well-being. Athletes must\n                            not only train their bodies but also nurture their minds and prioritize their overall health\n                            to excel in their chosen sport.\n                            <br> <br>\n                            Physical fitness forms the cornerstone of athletic prowess.\n                            Endurance, strength, flexibility, and agility are attributes that are honed through\n                            dedicated training regimens. However, achieving optimal physical health requires more than\n                            just rigorous workouts; it demands a balanced approach to nutrition, rest, and recovery.\n                            <br> <br>\n                            Nutrition serves as fuel for the body, providing the energy necessary for peak performance.\n                            A diet rich in nutrient-dense foods ensures that athletes have the stamina to endure\n                            grueling training sessions and competitions. Moreover, proper hydration is essential for\n                            maintaining optimal bodily functions and preventing fatigue.\n                            <br> <br>\n                            Equally important is the role of rest and recovery in the pursuit of health. Adequate sleep\n                            allows the body to repair and regenerate, enhancing muscle recovery and cognitive function.\n                            Rest days are not a sign of weakness but a strategic component of any training program,\n                            allowing athletes to prevent overuse injuries and maintain their overall well-being.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "article02-8b",
